		{"id":"text-welcome","type":"text","text":"# Main Canvas\n\nThis card tests **markdown rendering** inside a text card:\n\n- a wikilink to a note: [[getting-started]]\n- a wikilink to a canvas: [[second.canvas]]\n- `inline code` and *emphasis*\n\n> Blockquotes should render too.","x":-480,"y":-380,"width":440,"height":280,"color":"1"},
